{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>成軍僅3個月的「魔音女團 MYNT」日前於「ACE FACE OF HONG KONG STAR AWARDS 韓國最耀眼香港之星頒獎典禮 2026」上，勇奪「最耀眼新晉女子組合」大獎，6位成員以極搶眼的「黑金銀」色調晚裝華麗登場，對於火速獲得首個獎項，她們直言幸福來得太突然，究竟這份榮譽對初出道的她們帶來了怎樣的衝擊？</p><p>MYNT黑金銀戰衣登場 Ellyn透視長腿撼Hilary</p><p>在頒獎典禮當晚，MYNT 6位成員宋宛穎（Sabrina）、喬美莎（Chelsea）、倪樂琳（Ellyn）、倪嘉雯（Carmen）、盧映彤（Skylar）及莊子璇（Hilary）齊齊以「黑金銀」色調晚裝亮相，各有美態，瞬間成為全場焦點。當中以倪樂琳（Ellyn）大騷雪白長腿，對戰莊子璇（Hilary）的若隱若現透視長腿最為吸睛，而倪嘉雯（Carmen）則以一身勁裝大晒纖腰，展現完美身段，6人甫出場即秒殺不少菲林。</p><p>Carmen自爆收禁笑令 Chelsea奪新人獎難以置信</p><p>MYNT獲獎後接受訪問，對於成團短短3個月便獲得首個獎項，成員倪嘉雯（Carmen）笑言：「幸福來得太突然！」而同時榮獲「最耀眼電視新人」的喬美莎（Chelsea）亦坦言難以置信：「我入咗行好短時間，覺得（攞獎）好唔真實，好榮幸、好多謝大會畀我呢個機會。」隊長宋宛穎（Sabrina）則表示獲獎後更有動力：「信心唔敢講住，但動力一定有，令到我哋更加進步，將更好嘅舞台呈現畀觀眾。」提到新歌《Turn My Magic On》MV，Carmen自爆拍攝時壓力極大，因被導演下了「禁笑令」：「因為要對住鏡頭不停放電，我覺得自己最有自信係笑住放電，但導演就唔准我笑、落咗『禁笑令』畀我，所以好難。」</p><p>網民洗版式恭賀 期待MYNT更多舞台</p><p>MYNT極速奪獎的消息一出，網民紛紛湧入社交平台留言祝賀，反應熱烈。不少粉絲大讚她們的努力被看見：「恭喜MYNT！出道即攞獎好犀利！實至名歸！」亦有網民被她們的得獎戰衣驚艷：「個個都好靚，黑金造型好有氣勢！」、「Ellyn同Hilary對腳真係無得輸！」更有粉絲表示對她們的未來充滿期待：「好想快啲睇到新歌舞台！禁笑令好好笑，Carmen加油啊！」、「希望公司可以俾多啲資源佢哋，香港好耐冇咁齊人嘅女團！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_2262707126a952686c4fb8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_8762459586a9526893bfd7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_6330289936a95268b88cdd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_1113686706a95268e3e313.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_3926676556a952690aeba1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_17242384826a952692f2e3d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_17480967906a952695544c0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_10670053806a9526986ef76.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_976783246a95269bd54f0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_19770261716a9526a028f9d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_5364474026a9526a382008.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_18545203216a9526a720095.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_12095532746a9526aa74fab.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_13685645886a9526af6873f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_6285543266a9526b39b951.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_4618032536a9526b7b6e90.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_10278432676a9526bad80d2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_3680366696a9526be9c84b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_16034623306a9526c1ca69e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_11918653166a9526c58bf71.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_14629138906a9526c989800.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_2787023696a9526cda0131.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_1957444046a9526d0d175e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_1602567006a9526d437ffb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_4423080646a9526d7affe2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_21174733676a9526dc565d3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/31_16785410686a9526e03fcc2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/32_20248324086a9526e41e8c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/33_10950280616a9526e768f69.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T07:19:05.093259+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1220,"images":29,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}